1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:05,155
Boom, boom! Today is music day.

2
00:00:05,738 --> 00:00:09,883
I play the drum. Boom, boom, boom!

3
00:00:10,488 --> 00:00:13,666
I play the xylophone. Ding, ding!

4
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:18,544
I want to play too. But I feel nervous.

5
00:00:19,155 --> 00:00:23,433
Feeling nervous is okay. Morrow takes a big breath.

6
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:28,261
Let's try slowly. Clap with me, one, two.

7
00:00:28,863 --> 00:00:33,311
One, two. One, two. I can do it!

8
00:00:33,905 --> 00:00:38,925
Clap, boom, ding! Three friends play together.

9
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:43,201
You did it, Morrow! That sounded great.

10
00:00:43,822 --> 00:00:46,727
Trying slowly helped me feel brave.

11
00:00:47,322 --> 00:00:50,814
Small steps can help us try new things.

12
00:00:51,405 --> 00:00:53,937
What new thing would you like to try?
